vulnerabilities.suggested_fix:
Add the operator whitelist check to `registerAgentsWithSignature` similar to `registerAgents`:
```solidity
if (operatorWhitelist != address(0)) {
    if (!IOperatorWhitelist(operatorWhitelist).isOperatorWhitelisted(serviceId, operator)) {
        revert WrongOperator(serviceId);
    }
}
```
This should be added after verifying the service owner and before processing the signature.

Add msg.value validation for token-secured services in `registerAgentsWithSignature`:
```solidity
if (isTokenSecured) {
    uint256 totalBond = agentInstances.length * BOND_WRAPPER;
    if (msg.value != totalBond) {
        revert IncorrectAgentBondingValue(msg.value, totalBond, serviceId);
    }
    success = IService(serviceRegistry).registerAgents{value: totalBond}(...);
}
```
